<h2 style='margin:0 0 16px'>Reset your password</h2>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>Use the secure link below to choose a new password.</p>
<p style='text-align:center'><a
    href='{{actionUrl}}'
    style='display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;background:{{branding.primaryColor}};color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600'
  >Reset password</a></p>
<p style='font-size:13px;color:#666'>This link expires in
  {{expiresInMinutes}}
  minutes. If you did not request a reset, ignore this email.</p>